---
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';

// Public page, also while the shop is locked. Linked from the footer
// (admin → Teksten → Footer).
const email = 'amirdessouky@gmail.com';
---

<LegalPage
    title="return policy"
    file="returns.txt"
>
    <p class="block-legal-updated">Last updated: 24 November 2026</p>

    <h2>How to return</h2>
    <p>Please check the information below first to see if your item can be returned.</p>
    <ol>
        <li>
            Email us at <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a> within 14 days after you received your order. Include your order number and the products
            you wish to return (and why, if you like).
        </li>
        <li>Send the item back to us within 14 days after your email. See the shipping part below.</li>
        <li>
            Once we have received your return, we transfer the money back to you via the same payment method you used, within 14 days after your
            email.
        </li>
    </ol>

    <h2>Returns</h2>
    <p>
        You can return your order within 14 days after you received it, without giving a reason. If more than 14 days have passed since you received
        your order, unfortunately we can't offer you a refund or exchange.
    </p>
    <p>
        You may try your item on, the same way you would in a store. To be returned, it must be unworn, unwashed and in the same condition you
        received it, with the tags still attached and preferably in the original packaging. If an item comes back worn, washed or damaged, we may
        deduct the loss in value from your refund.
    </p>
    <p>To complete your return, please include your order number or the confirmation email of your order in your package.</p>

    <h2>Refunds</h2>
    <p>
        Once your return is received and inspected, we will send you an email to let you know we received it. We refund the price of the product
        and the original shipping costs of your order, via the same payment method you used. We may wait with the refund until we have received
        the item back.
    </p>

    <h2>Late or missing refunds</h2>
    <p>If you haven't received your refund yet:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>first check your bank account again;</li>
        <li>then contact your credit card company, it may take some time before your refund is officially posted;</li>
        <li>next contact your bank, there is often some processing time before a refund is posted.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>If you've done all of this and you still have not received your refund, please contact us at <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a>.</p>

    <h2>Exchanges</h2>
    <p>
        We only replace items if they are defective or damaged. If that's the case, send us an email at <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a> with a
        photo, and we will replace the item or refund you, including the return shipping costs.
    </p>
    <p>Want a different size? Return your item as described above and place a new order.</p>

    <h2>Shipping</h2>
    <p>To return your product, send us an email at <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a> and we'll send you the return address.</p>
    <p>
        You are responsible for paying your own shipping costs for returning your item (unless the item is defective or damaged). These return
        shipping costs are not refunded.
    </p>
    <p>
        We recommend using a trackable shipping service or buying shipping insurance, since we can't guarantee that we will receive your returned
        item.
    </p>
</LegalPage>
